How is it possible that you got identical fragments after hunting different monsters?
The ecosystem of this place was not created naturally.
It seems something created it, an ancestral power.

When we destroyed the Ice Crystal with the Fire Soul, Glacies had mentioned the God of Fire. Could this be the place where he rested and created the Fire Soul?

Take this Mysterious Crystal and collect the souls of the monsters.

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt 100 monsters in the Heart of Fire.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
